      "description": "The bean work-plan (beans/beans.json + beans/defs/, the layout the `beans` CLI reads through .beans.yml). Kept on its own branch, `cat/cat-harness/beans`, not on main (owner, 2026-10-10, re-confirmed 2026-11-15; issue #7642). The session-start hook installs the platform if it is absent and mounts it at `beans/` (`state:mount`); there is no read-only fallback (owner, 2026-11-15). An edit is pushed back with `bun folio-assistant/cat-harness-tools/scripts/branch-store.ts push --id beans`, a splice with `expect` that never forces, so a bean edit is no longer a commit in a PR.",
